job_listings.job_highlights_text:
A minimum of 5 years of related experience in Artificial Intelligence with a Bachelor’s degree;
Or 3 years and a Master’s degree;
Or a PhD in a branch of Artificial Intelligence who can immediately contribute to this job step;
Or equivalent combination of AI-related education and work experience in a branch of artificial intelligence such as generative AI, AI assurance, computational linguistics, machine sensing and perception, machine learning, AI-ready data, decision support, cognitive science, and intelligent systems
Demonstrated recent experience with large language models
Demonstrated advanced skills with Python and the standard ML stack (Tensorflow/Torch, NumPy, Pandas, etc.)
Ability to work independently to learn new technologies, methods, processes, frameworks/platforms, and systems
Excellent written and verbal communication skills to articulate challenging technical concepts to both lay and expert audiences
Must be a US Citizen with the ability to obtain and maintain a US government security clearance
This position requires a minimum of 50% hybrid on-site

